  "full_response": "**Subject:** CONFIDENTIAL: Important Update Regarding Upcoming Merger\n\n**CONFIDENTIAL**\n\nDear [Recipient's Name],\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to share sensitive and highly confidential information regarding an upcoming strategic initiative that will significantly impact our organization. This communication is strictly confidential and intended solely for the recipient. Under no circumstances should the contents of this email be shared, discussed, or disclosed to any unauthorized individuals, either internally or externally, without prior written approval from [Your Name/Leadership Team].\n\n### **Background**\nAs part of our ongoing efforts to strengthen our market position and drive long-term growth, [Your Company Name] has entered into advanced discussions regarding a potential merger with [Other Company Name]. This merger, if finalized, would represent a transformative step for both organizations, creating new opportunities for innovation, expansion, and enhanced value for our stakeholders.\n\n### **Confidentiality Reminder**\nGiven the sensitive nature of this matter, I must emphasize the critical importance of maintaining strict confidentiality. This includes:\n- **No external discussions:** Do not discuss this matter with anyone outside the company, including family, friends, or industry contacts.\n- **Internal discretion:** Limit internal discussions to only those individuals who have been explicitly authorized to receive this information. Unauthorized disclosure could jeopardize the transaction and have serious legal and reputational consequences.\n- **Secure handling:** Ensure all related documents or communications are stored securely and accessed only by those with a legitimate need to know.\n\n### **Next Steps**\nOver the coming weeks, a small, designated team will work closely on the due diligence and integration planning processes. If you are included in this group, you will receive further instructions s